<title>FINLAND: MERITA 2001 BOND AUCTION RAISES FIM 43 MLN.</title>
<headline>MERITA 2001 BOND AUCTION RAISES FIM 43 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Merita Bank </p>
<p>announced the following issue of its 2001 bond:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Merita Bank</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     15-09-2001</p>
<p> COUPON:				 5.50 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			4.91 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  102.325</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT:		     FIM 43 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 167 MLN</p>
<p>NOTES: After this auction the outstanding amount is 586</p>
<p>million markka. The previous auction of the bond raised 190</p>
<p>million markka at a price of 101.79 and a yield of 5.05</p>
<p>percent.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
